          "id": "aat:300435416",
          "type": "Type",
          "_label": "descriptive note"
        }
      ],
      "content": "pot, a vessel for holding liquids or food (OED s.v. pot n.1); made of earthenware, stoneware (incl. Málaga ware), tin, brass, bronze, latten/pewter, glass, crystal, leather, wickerwork, wood, silver or iron, covered or uncovered. Includes drinking pots and pots for apothecaries, goldsmiths, treacle, ink, etc. For the capacity-measure sense see pot (measure); for the pot-hanger see pot hanger."
    }
  ],
